@page "/huong-dan-su-dung"
@layout EmptyLayout
@attribute [AllowAnonymous]

<PageTitle>Huong dan dang ky tai khoan</PageTitle>

<div class="guide-shell">
    <div class="guide-page">
        <header class="guide-hero">
            <div class="guide-brandline">
                <img class="login-brand-image" src="/images/glc-logo.png" alt="GLC logo" />
                <div>
                    <div class="login-brandname">GLC Portal v2</div>
                    <div class="login-brandmeta">Huong dan dang ky tai khoan</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="guide-hero-copy">
                <div class="guide-kicker">Noi dung tong hop tu trang cu /khach-hang/dang-ky</div>
                <h1>Huong dan dang ky tai khoan va su dung he thong</h1>
                <p>
                    Chon dung bieu mau, hoan thien ho so va gui thong tin theo dung quy trinh de kich hoat tai khoan nhanh hon.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="guide-hero-actions">
                <a class="portal-secondary-action" href="/login">Quay lai dang nhap</a>
                <a class="portal-primary-action" href="/register">Di den dang ky</a>
            </div>
        </header>

        <section class="guide-section">
            <div class="guide-section-head">
                <span class="guide-section-kicker">Quy trinh dang ky</span>
            </div>

            <div class="guide-process-grid">
                <article class="guide-card guide-step-card">
                    <span class="guide-step-number">1</span>
                    <h2>Chon dung bieu mau</h2>
                    <p>Tai bieu mau danh cho ca nhan hoac doanh nghiep de dien dung thong tin ngay tu dau.</p>
                </article>

                <article class="guide-card guide-step-card">
                    <span class="guide-step-number">2</span>
                    <h2>Hoan thien ho so</h2>
                    <p>Kiem tra ma so thue, thong tin lien he va nguoi dai dien nhan lenh truoc khi gui.</p>
                </article>

                <article class="guide-card guide-step-card">
                    <span class="guide-step-number">3</span>
                    <h2>Kich hoat va su dung</h2>
                    <p>Sau khi duoc xac nhan, ban dang nhap he thong de tao lenh online va tra cuu thong tin hang.</p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="guide-section">
            <div class="guide-section-head">
                <span class="guide-section-kicker">Bieu mau dang ky</span>
            </div>

            <div class="guide-form-grid">
                <article class="guide-card guide-form-card">
                    <div class="guide-card-tag">Mau ho so</div>
                    <h2>Khach hang ca nhan</h2>
                    <p>Danh cho ca nhan truc tiep dang ky su dung dich vu va nhan thong tin giao hang.</p>
                    <ul class="guide-list">
                        <li>Thong tin nguoi dang ky</li>
                        <li>So dien thoai va email nhan thong bao</li>
                        <li>Ho so de dien, de doi chieu</li>
                    </ul>
                    <a class="portal-primary-action guide-download-button" href="/Areas/Data/upload/files/Mau-dang-ky-dich-vu-%20E-%20Warehouse-GLC-doanh-nghiep.doc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tai bieu mau ca nhan</a>
                </article>

                <article class="guide-card guide-form-card">
                    <div class="guide-card-tag">Mau ho so</div>
                    <h2>Khach hang doanh nghiep</h2>
                    <p>Phu hop voi doanh nghiep can quan ly tai khoan giao nhan, thong tin cong ty va bo phan phu trach.</p>
                    <ul class="guide-list">
                        <li>Ma so thue va thong tin phap ly</li>
                        <li>Nguoi lien he thuc hien giao dich</li>
                        <li>Thuan tien cho van hanh lau dai</li>
                    </ul>
                    <a class="portal-primary-action guide-download-button" href="/Areas/Data/upload/files/Mau-dang-ky-dich-vu-%20E-%20Warehouse-GLC-doanh-nghiep.doc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tai bieu mau doanh nghiep</a>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>

        <div class="guide-bottom-grid">
            <section class="guide-section guide-section-compact">
                <div class="guide-section-head">
                    <span class="guide-section-kicker">Luu y truoc khi gui ho so</span>
                </div>

                <div class="guide-card guide-note-card">
                    <ul class="guide-list guide-list-dense">
                        <li>Dien dung ho ten, so dien thoai va email de nhan thong bao kich hoat.</li>
                        <li>Voi doanh nghiep, can kiem tra chinh xac ma so thue, ten cong ty va dia chi xuat hoa don.</li>
                        <li>Ho so nen duoc ra soat ky truoc khi gui de tranh phai chinh sua nhieu lan.</li>
                        <li>Sau khi duoc cap tai khoan, ban co the dang nhap de tao lenh online va tra cuu hang nhap.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="guide-section guide-section-compact">
                <div class="guide-section-head">
                    <span class="guide-section-kicker">Can ho tro them?</span>
                </div>

                <div class="guide-support-grid">
                    <article class="guide-support-card">
                        <span class="guide-support-label">Dien thoai</span>
                        <strong>(84-225) 3979 550 - (84-225) 3262 156</strong>
                    </article>

                    <article class="guide-support-card">
                        <span class="guide-support-label">Email</span>
                        <strong>info@glc.com.vn</strong>
                    </article>

                    <article class="guide-support-card">
                        <span class="guide-support-label">Dia chi</span>
                        <strong>Lo dat CN3.2G KCN Dinh Vu, Dong Hai 2, Hai An, Hai Phong</strong>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
